<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">drowned-veil</ansi> (enchanting recipe)

A back-slot enchantment drawing on the conviction reservoir of the
wearer. The enchantment confers tiered charisma and magical
mitigation bonuses — the cloak seems to shimmer faintly when the
wearer is observed too directly. Uses two stillwater pearls per
casting.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       enchanting (minimum 40)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     enchanting circle
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> stillwater pearl (x2), chrysalis setting (x2),
                 binding paste (x1)

